  "overview": "Emeryville California Police Department uses Flock Safety technology to capture objective evidence without compromising on individual privacy. Emeryville California Police Department utilizes retroactive searches to solve crimes after they've occurred. Additionally, Emeryville California Police Department utilizes real-time alerting of hotlist vehicles to capture wanted criminals. In an effort to ensure proper usage and guardrails are in place, they have made the below policies and usage statistics available to the public.\n\nCommunity Impact\nData & Usage Summary",
